        <body>
            <div xml:id="d429">

                <pb facs="0618" n="498" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg498"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Reid to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1905-10-31"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">October 31, 1905</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 71.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to my dispatch No. 66 of the 24th
                    instant [not printed], I have the honor to inclose herewith the copy of a note
                    which I have received from Lord Lansdowne relating to the Newfoundland fisheries
                    question.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Whitelaw Reid.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d429-a1.xml" xpointer="d429-a1"/>
